# Pins Renovate tracks that no package manifest carries. Sourced, not executed.

# The project-standard release the files in STANDARD.lock were vendored from. Renovate raises it and
# packaging/refresh-pins.sh re-vendors to match on the same branch. Stored without the tag's leading
# `v`: the Renovate pattern requires a digit first.
# renovate: datasource=gitea-tags depName=SisyphusMD/project-standard
PROJECT_STANDARD="0.1.28"
